 "description": "Lists card disputes. Set filter.card_id to see the disputes filed on one card, or filter.company_id to see every dispute across a company (the caller's access is verified server-side). Returns each dispute's id, card, disputed transaction, amount, status (filed, pending review, accepted, won, lost, rejected, or withdrawn), reason, and when it was filed and resolved. Use page_size and page_token to page through long lists.",
